---
import DemoLayout from '../../layouts/DemoLayout.astro';
---
<DemoLayout title="Overview" activeNav="overview">
  <h1 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">StoneCharts Demo</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    Deterministic, multi-language chart rendering where every chart change is
    provable. Explore rendered outputs, measured benchmarks, and a real
    conformance proof below.
  </p>

  <!-- Quick stats -->
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    <div class="stat card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="stat-value">7</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Certified chart types</div>
      <div class="stat-context">Line, column, area, bar, scatter, bubble, combo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="stat-value">2</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Verified runtimes</div>
      <div class="stat-context">Python 3.14.4 &amp; Go 1.26.4</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat card" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="stat-value" style="color: var(--success);">PASS</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Byte-identity status</div>
      <div class="stat-context">Same spec, same SHA-256</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Navigation cards -->
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    <a href="/demo/gallery/" class="card" style="text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--accent); margin: 0;">Chart Gallery</h3>
        <span class="badge">Interactive</span>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        Fifteen chart types with tooltips, crosshair, legend toggle, and keyboard
        navigation. Light and dark themes. Every SVG is actual golden output from
        certified renderers.
      </p>
    </a>
    <a href="/demo/benchmarks/" class="card" style="text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--accent); margin: 0;">Benchmarks</h3>
        <span class="badge">SC-QUAL-003</span>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        Cold-start, throughput, concurrent load, determinism, and dependency
        surface — measured against Highcharts, Vega, ECharts, Plotly, and
        QuickChart.
      </p>
    </a>
    <a href="/demo/verify/" class="card" style="text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--accent); margin: 0;">StoneVerify</h3>
        <span class="badge-success badge">PASS</span>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem;">
        A real conformance proof: same spec rendered by Python and Go, producing
        byte-identical SVG. SHA-256 evidence, structural comparison, and CI
        integration template.
      </p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Disclosure -->
  <div class="card" style="background: var(--accent-subtle); border-color: var(--accent);">
    <h3 style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
      What this demo shows
    </h3>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
      Rendered chart outputs (golden SVGs), measured benchmark data from SC-QUAL-003,
      and StoneVerify conformance evidence. No source code, packages, or installable
      artifacts are distributed. All benchmark numbers are single-host, vendor-run
      measurements — reproducible and disclosed, not independently audited.
    </p>
  </div>
</DemoLayout>
